> ***
. ********************** gen Zeng Guofan period dummies
. 
. gen Post=0 if year<1854
(825 missing values generated)

. replace Post=1 if year>=1854&year<=1864
(825 real changes made)

. 
. 
. 
. foreach y of varlist Zeng_all0_invdist_pc Zeng_all0_pc Zenghu_all Zenghu_all_
> invdist  Zeng_all0 Zeng_all0_invdist  Zeng_exam0_invdist  Zeng_BMF_invdist Ze
> ng_Juren_invdist lnarea capital lnurbanpop  lnpop  dist_nanjing lnjinshi lnqu
> otas mainriv route1 dist2canal lnwheat lnrice  {
  2. gen `y'_Post=`y'*Post
  3. 
. }

. 
